// {name people type, real domain}. Included by lookalike_brands.cc only.
//
// These are the sites that scam addresses copy most: where people log in,
// pay, ship or buy. Keep it short on purpose. Each name is compared with
// what a visitor's address looks like, so a name that is also an ordinary
// word earns a false alarm. Names under four letters are left out for that
// reason ("dhl", "ups", "att").
//
// The name is the part before the ending, lower case, plain a-z and 0-9.
// A name that differs from its domain ("canadapost") is listed by the name
// scammers would type.

